{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788049919879673607,"compiled_state":{"alias":"sanidine-cilium-eland","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"bd73ed180a0b8a04469f806599e129e8a77abf0a8d9bec7212bb75ac6cca202f","event_uuid":"f4648893-3ea6-4238-b969-89b5a020c23e","position":{"commit_sha":"5d4bd6270248b1d6eda0c06d30301ceffd029d76","position":"1788045324939946633-f4648893-3ea6-4238-b969-89b5a020c23e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"85b990cc6bb67e16746ffbe5419952cba8b2435a32e38c04df1932573eca4f90","event_uuid":"c1f2b1ff-a2d1-4ffb-af40-954f3d1cd7ea","position":{"commit_sha":"05dcba4f89c8f58de8c538944d54ad0a4b6d358b","position":"1788045351167436986-c1f2b1ff-a2d1-4ffb-af40-954f3d1cd7ea"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788045324939946633,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c1f2b1ff-a2d1-4ffb-af40-954f3d1cd7ea","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"35ab-f0e0-3e4a-4b72"}],"description":"Split from 35ab-f0e0-3e4a-4b72 (fightable-nirvanic-kitten) — the executor unknown-step site was fixed there; THIS site was escalated because it needs a NEW error-code design decision the operator directed not be made inline.\n\n## Site\n`src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor.py:475` — `raise WorkflowError(\"the editor front-end bundle is missing (.../editor.js). Build it with: npm ... build\")` (raised when `assets_available()` is False).\n\n## Why escalated, not fixed inline\n1. **Design decision required.** The correct error code is genuinely ambiguous — a missing LOCAL BUILD ARTIFACT is neither `invalid_input` (the caller's path is fine) nor caller-`not_found` (the caller named no missing resource; the environment is unbuilt). It may warrant a NEW vocabulary code (e.g. a dependency/asset-unavailable code) or a deliberate mapping to an existing one (`command_failed`?). Choosing is a `KNOWN_ERROR_CODES` vocabulary/design decision.\n2. **Not observably misclassified today.** `edit_workflow` is CLI-only — it is NOT registered as an MCP tool. The CLI `_workflow_edit` (`src/rebar/_cli/_workflow_commands.py:128`) catches `WorkflowError` and prints the raw `Error: <msg>` (exit 1); it never routes through `error_code_for`. So the bare `WorkflowError` here never actually surfaces as `llm_unavailable` on any live surface — the `error_code_for` mapping is latent. Fixing it would change behavior only for a hypothetical future MCP exposure, which is speculative rather than restoration of an observed misclassification.\n\n## Acceptance (needs operator input)\n- [ ] Operator decides the intended error code for a missing editor build artifact (new code vs existing; and whether this site should even be classified given it is CLI-only today).\n- [ ] If a code is chosen: dedicated `WorkflowError` subclass mirroring `WorkflowNotFoundError`, mapped in `error_code_for`/`_workflow_caller_code`, tested through the actual surface, execute-time outages still `llm_unavailable`, vocabulary + docs (mcp-reference / common.schema.json) updated.\n\ncaused_by shares the parent's origin (8a31-e1c3-cf31-4239) — the blanket LLMError→llm_unavailable mapping.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"551b-1a30-ac2b-4127","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Editor missing-bundle WorkflowError: decide error code (escalated design decision; currently CLI-only/latent)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f4648893-3ea6-4238-b969-89b5a020c23e","c1f2b1ff-a2d1-4ffb-af40-954f3d1cd7ea"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788049919879673607,"uuid":"645dd194-f42d-4a4f-b637-e4394add5b68"}